@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title State Machine — Queue Ticket Status (Phase 2)

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  FontSize 14
  StartColor #0F766E
  EndColor #B91C1C
  ArrowColor #455A64
}

[*] --> WAITING : Patient check-in\nor visit created with queue ticket

WAITING --> CALLED : Receptionist / Nurse calls patient\n(display / audio)
WAITING --> CANCELLED : Patient does not arrive

CALLED --> IN_SERVICE : Patient starts service
CALLED --> CANCELLED : Patient cancels

IN_SERVICE --> DONE : Service completed

DONE --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of WAITING
QueueTicket stores:
- queueNumber (display order)
- calledAt (null until called)
- startedAt (null until in service)
end note

note right of IN_SERVICE
Phase 2 feature.
Tracks real-time service time
per patient for performance reporting.
end note

@enduml
